  (text "v0.4. Switch on the carrier axis. Two 1x3 headers, plastic on the underside, long pin down into the H11 sockets on the main PCB.\nFour M2x35 standoffs and frame tabs 7 and 8 are GND. No LEDs. No round-stop tab. No ESD or pull-ups on this board.\nJ1 and J2 are Samtec TSW-103-20-T-S, consigned (same -20 lead as LCSC C3345998, which is the 2-row part)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "626c6039-5bcd-4c16-bcd4-64f4534e3807"))
